==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*20 [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*20 [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*6 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Coco (Enemy)|Coco]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Pokota (Enemy)|Pokota]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

